UnitGuardedAccessControlEnumerable::revokeRole
├── when the role is not self administering
│   └── it should remove the role from the holder
├── when the role is self administering but the account is not a holder
│   └── it should leave the role membership unchanged
├── when revoking a non last holder of a self administering role
│   └── it should remove the role from the holder
└── when revoking the last holder of a self administering role
    └── it should revert with LastRoleHolder

UnitGuardedAccessControlEnumerable::renounceRole
├── when renouncing a non last holder of a self administering role
│   └── it should remove the role from the caller
└── when renouncing the last holder of a self administering role
    └── it should revert with LastRoleHolder
